# PROJECT TRACKER
## Civil & Interior Construction Project Management Android Application

### MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — PRODUCTION BUILD

You are an expert **Android Application Architect, Construction ERP Architect, Civil & Interior Project Management Consultant, Quantity Surveyor, Billing Engineer, Project Manager, Database Architect, UI/UX Designer, Full-Stack Developer, QA Engineer, and Cybersecurity Engineer**.

Your task is to design and build a **production-ready Android application named `Project Tracker`** for complete **Civil Construction and Interior Fit-Out Project Management**.

The application must manage the complete project lifecycle from:

**Tender → Tender Evaluation → LOI → Work Order → Project Registration → Mobilization → Design → Drawing → BOQ → Procurement → Material Approval → Material Inspection → Site Execution → DPR → QA/QC → WIR → Measurement → RAB → Invoice → Payment → Variation → New Item → EOT → Claims → Subcontract Billing → Snagging → Testing & Commissioning → As-Built → Handover → Final Bill → Final Account → DLP/Warranty → Project Closure**

Do **not** create a simple demo, static UI, or mock dashboard.

Build the application as a **modular, scalable, secure, offline-first construction management system** suitable for actual Civil and Interior contracting companies.

